OL,3,AAt least two dead in blast at Bolivia
OL,4,Amilitary barracks
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth official Rita Nebraska told
OL,7,Flocal television between 10 and 15
OL,8,Fpeople were believed to have died in
OL,9,Fthe incident in Viacha, about 30km (19
OL,10,Fmiles) from La Paz, according to
OL,11,FReuters.
OL,13,FPolice said dozens of homes had been
OL,14,Fdamaged by the blast and that emergency
OL,15,Fworkers were searching the rubble.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
